Here’s the request you’d send to VirusTotal to cast a “malicious” vote for the IP address **22.242.75.136** using your API key (`key_four`):

```json
{
  "url": "https://www.virustotal.com/api/v3/ip_addresses/22.242.75.136/votes",
  "method": "POST",
  "headers": {
    "accept": "application/json",
    "content-type": "application/json",
    "x-apikey": "key_four"
  },
  "body": {
    "type": "vote",
    "attributes": {
      "verdict": "malicious"
    }
  }
}
```

Replace `"key_four"` with your actual API key value before sending the request.

